"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/controller/adaptive_gripper_controller/README.md)."
" How to refresh the pin (and recompute `:start-line:` / `:end-line:`): "
"[Documentation Build](../../5-developer/2-docs_build.md#vendored-"
"upstream-readme)."
msgstr ""
"钉选：[`9a1da3ba`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/controller/adaptive_gripper_controller/README.md)。如何刷新钉选（并重算"
" `:start-line:` / `:end-line:`）：[文档构建](../../5-developer/2-docs_build.md"
"#vendored-upstream-readme)。"

